sequenceDiagram
    participant User
    participant Component
    participant useCart
    participant CartStore
    participant RocketRezAPI
    participant localStorage

    User->>Component: Adds item to cart
    Component->>useCart: Calls mutation hook
    useCart->>RocketRezAPI: POST request
    RocketRezAPI-->>useCart: Cart response
    useCart->>CartStore: Update state
    CartStore->>localStorage: Persist
    CartStore->>useCart: State change
    useCart->>Component: Auto-remove insurance if needed
    Component->>User: UI updates
